(1492, 1, 'Peníze a potraviny (Survey of Prague, Brno and Plzeň food prices)', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '<h2>Peníze a potraviny</h2>        <p>Read this transcript of a radio        broadcast about food prices in the Czech Republic and complete the table        below:<br>        <i>(Remember, Czech fractions use a comma e.g. 13,50. Put an \'x\' in field        where you don\'t know the information.)</i></p>        <p>V        Praze dnes stojí potraviny méně ne třeba v Brně nebo v Plzni.        Například mléko stojí v Brně jedenáct korun osmdesát, ale v Praze        jenom deset devadesát. Chleba stojí v Plzni patnáct čtyřicet, v Brně        čtrnáct osmdesát a v Praze někde jen dvanáct devadesát. Rohlíky        stojí vude přiblině stejně, jednu korunu a deset haléřů.        Brambory stojí osm korun za kilogram v Praze, ale v Brně třeba        i jedenáct padesát. Sýr stojí v Brně čtrnáct korun za deset        deka a v Praze jen třináct dvacet. Kuřecí salám stojí osm korun        za deset deka v Praze i v Brně, ale v Plzni je za devět třicet.        Jenom alkohol stojí víc v Praze ne mimo Prahu. Půl litr piva        stojí v praské hospodě průměrně sedmnáct osmdesát, zatímco        v Brně a v Plzni si můete koupit pivo i za třináct korun.        </p>        <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">              <p>Praha</p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">              <p>Brno</p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">              <p>Plzeň              </p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>milk</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:10,90)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:11,80)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:x)]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>bread</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:12,90)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:14,80)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:15,40)]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>bread roll</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:1,10)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:1,10)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:1,10)]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>potatoes 1 kg</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:8)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:11,50)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:x)]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>cheese 100 g</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:14)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:14)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:x)]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p align=\"left\">chicken              salami 100 g</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:8)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:8)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:9,30)]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>beer 0,5 l</p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:17,80)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:13)]             </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 5:13)]             </td>          </tr>        </table> ', 3, NULL),
(1493, 1, 'Dialog v kanceláři', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '        <h2>Dialog v kanceláři</h2>        </div>        <p><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/office1.gif\" width=\"708\" height=\"592></span></p>        <h3>Content questions</h3>        <p>Who        is Mr. Malina waiting for?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>Why is he waiting for the person?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>What does Mr. Malina want to drink?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>What sort of mineral water does he prefer?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>Why is Mr. Malina asking for pen and paper?<br>  [$1, text 60]  <p>        <h3>Language questions</h3>        <p>Find all        direct objects and explain what rule was applied.<br>  [$1, textarea 90,6] <p>  Translate all verbs and explain whether they are in the        infinitive or a finite form.<br>  [$1, textarea 90,10]  ', 3, NULL),
(1494, 1, 'Jídelní lístek', 'Reading U2', 1, '', ' <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">          <tr>            <td width=\"604\" valign=\"top\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>Jídelní lístek</b></p>              <div>                <p><b>Polévky                </b></p>              </div>              <p>Slepičí              nudlová polévka..........................................................................................              27.40</p>              <p>Hovězí              vývar s játrovými knedlíčky.........................................................................              21.20</p>              <p>Bramborová              polévka s čerstvou zeleninou ......................................................... 29.90</p>              <p>Smetanová              ampiónová polévka ......................................................................... 28.50</p>              <div>                <p><b>Hotová jídla                </b></p>              </div>              <p>Kuře,              brambor, salát................................................................................................              82.00</p>              <p>Vepřové              maso, zelí, knedlík....................................................................................              98.00</p>              <p>Rybí              filé, hranolky, obloha.......................................................................................              74.00</p>              <p>Hovězí              gulá, rýe.................................................................................................... 89.00</p>              <div>                <p><b>Bezmasá jídla                </b></p>              </div>              <p>Smaený              sýr, tatarská omáčka..............................................................................65.00</p>              <p>Palačinka              se lehačkou..........................................................................................              35.00</p>              <p>pagety              se sýrem.................................................................................................... 59.00</p>              <p>Zeleninové              rizoto...................................................................................................... 43.00</p>              <div>                <p><b>Nápoje                </b></p>              </div>              <p>Turecká              káva............................................................................................................23.00</p>              <p>Vídeňská              káva..........................................................................................................28.00</p>              <p>Irská              káva.................................................................................................................. 35.00</p>              <p>Ovocný              dus (pomerančový, jablkový, meruňkový)...............................................              25.00</p>              <p>Víno              (červené a bílé) ................................................................................................              32.00</p>              <p>Pivo              (točené)............................................................................................................. 12.80</p>              <p>Minerálka              (s bublinkami a bez bublinek) ...............................................................              15.00</p>              <p align=\"left\"> </p>            </td>          </tr>        </table>        <p><b>Identify all nouns not in the        Nominative. Guess which share a case.        </b></p><p>  [$1, textarea 90,5] <p>        <p><b>Identify the gender of all        nouns in the Nominative from their endings.</b></p>  [$1, textarea 90,5] <p>        <p><b>List adjectives and sort them        into soft and hard.        </b></p>  [$1, textarea 90,5]   ', 3, NULL),
(1495, 1, 'Vocative in Reading (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>Píseň</h2>         <p>Identify the Vocative and explain         its use. <a href=\"tuit/sound/reading/jednadvetristyrypet.rm\">Click here to listen         to the song.</a></p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,5]   </td>             <td width=\"50%\"><a href=\"tuit/sound/reading/jednadvetristyrypet.rm\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/vocati4.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"335\" height=\"147></a></span></td>           </tr>         </table>         <p align=\"right\"> </p>           <h2>Citát          </h2>         <p>The         famous romantic poem <i> Máj         </i>written at the beginning of the 19<sup>th</sup>         century by <i>Karel         Hynek Mácha </i>ends with these words. What is         the position of the person saying these words? What are names of the         people as they would be displayed e.g. in church records.</p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/vocati5.gif\" width=\"244\" height=\"146></span></td>             <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 42,5]   </td>           </tr>         </table> ', 3, ''),
(1496, 1, 'Znát,vědět,umět', NULL, 49, '', '  [$1, select:umím/(znám/vím] Prahu.   [$1, select:umím/znám/(vím] , kde je Národní divadlo.   [$1, select:umím/(znám/vím] tu restauraci.   [$1, select:(umím)/znám/vím] trochu česky.   [$1, select:umím/znám/(vím)] , kdo je to.   [$1, select:(umím)/znám/vím] hrát golf.   [$1, select:umím/(znám)/vím] český film.   [$1, select:umím/(znám)/vím]  Davida.   [$1, select:umím/znám/(vím)] ,co má Eva.   [$1, select:umím/znám/(vím)] ,e Jana mluví anglicky. ', 3, ''),
(1497, 1, 'Adding v, ve, na', NULL, 49, '', 'el jsem   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  potu. Byl jsem   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  galerii.   [$1, select:/(V/Ve/Na]  úterý jsem byl   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  diskotéce. Bydlel jsem   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  Americe.   [$1, select:/V/Ve/(Na]  křiovatce zahněte doleva. Hráli jsme fotbal   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  parku. Díval jsem se   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  televizi. Studoval jsem   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  koleji. Jeli jsme   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  nádraí. Jedli jsme  [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  restauraci.   [$1, select:/V/(Ve/Na]  středu jsem četl knihu. Byli jsme   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  kině.   ', 3, ''),
(1498, 1, '<i>To be</i> and to <i>have</i> (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', ' <h2>Vtip</h2>     <p>Complete     the conjugation of the verb with all personal pronouns and infinitive. Why do     you think this was considered funny.</p>     <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">       <tr>         <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,13]   </td>         <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t6.gif\" alt=Obrázek císlo/No. 045\" width=\"334\" height=\"359\"></span></td>       </tr>     </table>     <h2>Citát</h2>   <p>Who said   this? Translate word for word and double-check with a dictionary. </p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"42%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t1.gif\" width=\"240\" height=\"144></span></td>             <td width=\"58%\">  [$1, textarea 40,7]   </td>           </tr>         </table>   <p> </p>     <h2>Přísloví    </h2>   <p>Use <a href=\"../../dictionary/dictionarytop.htm\">   dictionary</a> to discover one rule of the plural for nouns and adjectives.</p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,7]   </td>             <td width=\"50%\">               <p align=\"center\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t2.gif\" width=\"268\" height=\"167></span></td>           </tr>         </table>   <p align=\"left\"> </p>     <h2>Píseň</h2>   <p>This is the chorus of a popular 80s   rock song. What is its message?</p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"36%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t3.gif\" width=\"202\" height=\"147></span></td>             <td width=\"64%\">  [$1, textarea 44,7]   </td>           </tr>         </table> ', 3, ''),
(1499, 1, 'Spelling (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', ' <h3>Try some English words in Czech spelling</h3>       <p>Pronounce       the words in English, and then try to think what it would sound like to a       Czech.       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"5\" cellpadding=\"0\">         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             feet           </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             leisure           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             law           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             hair           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             ship           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             spa           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             duty           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             cheap           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             sports           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             stow           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             you           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             airport           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             uzi           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             ruin           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             house           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             tutor           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             doom           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             low           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>       </table>       <h3>Now try to jot down how you would spell the following Czech words in       English</h3>       <p>Given       the rules for Czech spelling, try to pronounce the below words as you       think they would be pronounced by a Czech, and then write them as they       sound to you in English.       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"5\" cellpadding=\"0\">         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             dobrý           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             den            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             čau            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             dobrou            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             noc            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             &#345;íkat            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             d&#283;kuju            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             Luke            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             jak            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             ena            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             dít&#283;            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             mu            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             n&#283;co            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             n&#283;jaký            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             t&#283;lo            </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             d&#367;m            </td>           <td width