(1941, 1, 'Weekly Schedule', 'Reading U3', 49, '', '<h2>Rozvrh na týden</h2>        <h3>Fill in dictionary (nominative)forms of the days of the week using case chart</h3>        <p><img width=\"338\" height=\"457\" src=\"weekly1.gif\">        <img width=\"249\" height=\"455\" src=\"weekly2.gif\"></span></p>        <h3>Fill in the schedule according to text (use case charts to determine nominative forms of items)</h3>        <table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">          <tr>            <td width=\"52\">              <p align=\"center\"> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>9:00-10:00</b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>10:00-11:00</b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>11:00-12:00</b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>12:00:13:00</b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>13:00-14:00</b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>14:00-15:00</b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"80\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>15:00-16:00</b></p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"52\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>PO              </b></p>            </td>            <td valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 10]             </td>            <td valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 10]             </td>            <td valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 10]             </td>            <td>              <p align=\"center\">oběd             </td>            <td valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 10]             </td>            <td valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 10]             </td>            <td valign=\"top\">  [$1, text 10]             </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"52\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>