(1268, 20, 'Sarah Hoffman', 'hoffmans14@yahoo.com', 'Rock Climbing in Albania?', 'Hi all,\r\n\r\nI\'m supposed to arrive in Albania in March 2004 to teach English.\r\nI read somewhere that Albania is supposed to have good rock climbing. What\'s the Peace Corps\' policy on volunteers rock climbing?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nSarah\r\n', '2004-01-19 19:26:29', 0, 0),
