ne; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;<SPAN lang=CS \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal><I>Neo-raked<o:p></o:p></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;<SPAN lang=CS \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal><I>Aftersteak<o:p></o:p></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;<SPAN lang=CS \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal><I>Undergater<o:p></o:p></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;<SPAN lang=CS \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal><I>Ghostess<o:p></o:p></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;<SPAN lang=CS \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal><I>Mother introduced<o:p></o:p></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 232.15pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" \r\nvAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n', '2002-10-17 03:05:08', 751, 143, 100),
(76, 'Not in the dictionary?', '', 'Some words may be in the dictionary but that doesn\'t make translating them any easier. Here are some of them. Each week, the course will spend a little time on one of these problem words. The results of our discussion will be added here.', '<p>assertivity<br>\r\ntraining<br>\r\nobjective, goal<br>\r\nbread<br>\r\nwater<br>\r\nbeer<br>\r\nnegotiation<br>\r\nskill<br>\r\nresearch<br>\r\nnetworking<br>\r\nsmall talk<br>\r\nchallenge<br>\r\npromote<br>\r\nencourage<br>\r\ntechnically</p>\r\n', '2002-10-18 01:29:23', 730, 143, 127),
(77, 'Culture definitions', '', 'Consider the Iceberg model of culture (and some of the other definitions) as you\'re thinking about what constitutes your identity.', '<center><img src=images/czechculture/aboutculture/iceberg_model.gif></center>\r\n\r\n<TABLE style=\"BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt\" \r\ncellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 border=0>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 3.5pt; PADDING-LEFT: 3.5pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 230.25pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" \r\nvAlign=top width=307>\r\n<P class=Quotation>Culture is the collective programming of the mind which \r\ndistinguishes the members of one human group from another.</P>\r\n<P class=QuoteAuthor>Geert Hofstede</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal> <SPAN \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 3.5pt; PADDING-LEFT: 3.5pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 230.25pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" \r\nvAlign=top width=307>\r\n<P class=Quotation>Culture is the set of shared assumptions, values and beliefs \r\nof a group of people by which they organize their common life.</P>\r\n<P class=QuoteAuthor>Gary Wederspahn</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal> <SPAN \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 3.5pt; PADDING-LEFT: 3.5pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 230.25pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" \r\nvAlign=top width=307>\r\n<P class=Quotation>Culture is an integrated system of learned behavior patterns \r\nthat are characteristic of the members of any given society. Culture refers to \r\nthe total way of life for a particular group of people. It includes everything \r\nthat a group of people thinks, says, does and makes its customs, language, \r\nmaterial artifacts and shared systems of attitudes and feelings.</P>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 42.55pt\"><SPAN \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">Culture is learned and transmitted from \r\ngeneration to generation.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=QuoteAuthor>Robert Kohls</P>\r\n<P class=Quotation> <o:p></o:p></P></TD>\r\n<TD \r\nstyle=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 3.5pt; PADDING-LEFT: 3.5pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 230.25pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" \r\nvAlign=top width=307>\r\n<P class=Quotation>Culture hides more than what it reveals and strangely enough \r\nwhat it hides, it hides most effectively from its own participants.</P>\r\n<P class=QuoteAuthor>Edward T. Hall</P>\r\n<P class=Quotation>Culture refers to whatever an identifiable group of people \r\nshare in order to meet its basic human needs and provides its sense of \r\nidentity.</P>\r\n<P class=QuoteAuthor>Jean-Claude Arteau</P>\r\n<P class=Quotation> <o:p></o:p></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n', '2002-10-18 01:34:29', 497, 152, 20),
(78, 'Reaching for the other culture through your own', '', 'A little tool to help people think about the cultural baggage they carry with them.', '<P class=MsoNormal><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">Culture is so much a \r\npart of you that you may not realize how your culture is influencing your views. \r\nUnderstanding your own values can be a painful process when you contrast them \r\nwith those of somebody from a different background. Plus it is often difficult \r\nto tell apart what is a cultural influence and what is your own personal \r\nidiosyncrasy. Think thoughts like: What does it mean to me to be a ___________?, \r\nWhat values are important to me?, What am I proud of?, What am I ashamed \r\nof?, How can I explain this to some one else? This worksheet is designed to \r\nhelp you start the process and think about answers to some of these \r\nquestions.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<H3><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">Imagine that you need to explain to \r\nsomebody else what it means for you personally to belong to your nation. Think of one \r\n<o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 54pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">dead \r\nperson<o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 54pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">person \r\nstill alive<o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 54pt\"><SPAN \r\nstyle=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">historical event<o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 54pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">artifact \r\n(book, place, city, building, piece of art) <o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 54pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">common \r\nsaying<o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>\r\n<H3><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"> that will explain to somebody else \r\nwhat it means to you to be Czech/British (or English or Scottish). Explain why these are good examples for \r\nthat and how you think it will help you explore another culture.</SPAN></H3>\r\n', '2002-10-18 01:38:10', 372, 152, 10),
(79, 'National symbols (Czech, Irish, Scottish)', '', 'Results of the discussion we had in class over the exercise above.', '<TABLE BORDER CELLSPACING=1 CELLPADDING=9 WIDTH=738>\r\n<TR><TD WIDTH=\"19%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\"> </TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"31%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Czech</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Irish</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Scottish</B></FONT></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR><TD WIDTH=\"19%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Dead person</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"31%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Jára Cimrman, Svatý Václav, Jan Svatopluk Presl, Jan Hus</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Oscar Wilde, Bean Mhic, W. B. Yeats, Samuel Becket</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Burke and Hare, Mary Queen of Scots</FONT></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR><TD WIDTH=\"19%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Person still alive</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"31%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Radislav Kinský, Václav Havel</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Bertie Ahern, Mary Robinson</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Tony Blair, Billy Connolly</FONT></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR><TD WIDTH=\"19%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Historical event</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"31%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Munich Treaty, World War II, 1948, 1968, 1989, Battle of the White Mountain</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>1916 Rising, Pope visit to Ireland, Civil War(1922)</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>protestant migration fromUK to North America (18<SUP>th</SUP> century and later), the 1707 Act of Union</FONT></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR><TD WIDTH=\"19%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Artifact</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"31%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>The Kralice Bible, Prague Castle, Prague, Good Soldier vejk</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>Book of Kells, Dublin, Trinity College, </FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>the church Ceilidh, Lanark by Alasdair Gray</FONT></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR><TD WIDTH=\"19%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<B><FONT SIZE=3><P>Saying</B></FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"31%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT FACE=\"Times New Roman\" SIZE=3><P>Tak douho se chodí se dbánem pro vodu, a se ucho utrhne., zlatý český ručičky, To chce klid a nohy v teple.</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>\"thanks a million\", \"my cousin is from there\", something negative of self-deprecating</FONT></TD>\r\n<TD WIDTH=\"25%\" VALIGN=\"TOP\">\r\n<FONT SIZE=3><P>\"Dont Put All Your Eggs In One Basket.\", \"posh\"</FONT></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n', '2002-10-18 16:36:20', 384, 152, 15);
