.. 1992 Úmluvu o ochraně světového kulturního a přírodního dědictví. Dodnes se k (2).. připojilo přes 270 států, na jejich území je 378 míst, (3).. patří ke Světovému dědictví. Koncem roku 1992 (4).. do seznamu UNESCO zařazena Československá republika a její tři významné lokality: Praha, Telč a Český Krumlov.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Český Krumlov najdeme v (5) .. Čechách nad řekou Vltavou. První zpráva o něm se (6) .. roku 1253. U ve středověku se město stalo hospodářským a kulturním (7) .. irokého okolí. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Původními staviteli byli páni z Krumlova, jedna z větví známého lechtického <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(8) .. Vítkovců. Po jejich vymření roku 1302 se Krumlov stal (9</SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">) </SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">.. pánů z Romberka, nejmocnějí české lechty, která a do počátku sedmnáctého (10) .. vlastnila největí panství v Čechách. Významný diplomat a politik Českého království Vilém z Romberka zahájil ve druhé polovině estnáctého století přestavbu středověkého hradu na renesanční lechtické sídlo. V této době (11) .. město největího rozkvětu. (12) .. po smrti bezdětného Viléma jeho mladí bratr Petr Vok prodává Krumlov císaři Rudolfu II. V první (13) .. osmnáctého století získávají město Schwarzenberkové.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Kadý turista rád (14) .. starobylé centrum Českého (15) .. . Návtěvníky láká zámek, který je po Praském hradu nejrozsáhlejí v Čechách. Uličky starého města jsou (16) .. architektonicky zajímavých renesančních domů. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Český Krumlov získává prostředky zejména z turistického ruchu. Zámek patří státu, který na jeho zachování věnuje značné (17) .. prostředky. Obyvatelé Českého Krumlova se snaí citlivě spojit historickou tvář města se současností.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Českokrumlovský rozvojový fond nabídl investorům za pomoci zahraničních poradců 50 <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(18) .. objektů k opravě a vyuití ke komerčním účelům, které vak musí být schváleny. Ve městě můe být jen určitý počet lůek a v úzkých uličkách se (19) .. procházet jen určitý počet návtěvníků.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Můeme jen doufat, e si Český Krumlov nadále zachová svou kouzelnou a neopakovatelnou atmosféru starých časů a e komerční vyuití města bude prostředkem k jeho dalímu (20) .. .<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">II. Indicate which statement is correct.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">1.<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Český Krumlov byl ve středověku<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; tab-stops: list 54.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo10\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(a)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">bezvýznamnou vesnicí<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; tab-stops: list 54.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo10\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(b)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">hlavním městem romberského panství<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(c) důleitým centrem hospodářství a kultury jiních Čech<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(d) turisticky zajímavým místem<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">2.<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Ve čtrnáctém století bydleli v Krumlově<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt 72.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(a)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">páni z Krumlova<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt 72.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(b)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Schwarzenberkové<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt 72.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(c)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Romberkové<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt 72.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(d)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Vítkovci<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">3.<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Petr Vok byl<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo11\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(a)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">zakladatelem rodu Vítkovců<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo11\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(b)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">bratrancem Viléma z Romberka<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo11\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(c)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">starostou Českého Krumlova<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo11\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(d)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">bratrem Viléma z Romberka<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">4.<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Českokrumlovský zámek<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo12\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(a)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">je svou rozlohou největí ve střední Evropě<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo12\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(b)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">je větí ne Praský hrad<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo12\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(c)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">byl po rekonstrukci rozířen<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo12\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(d)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">je druhým největím zámeckým areálem v Čechách<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">5.<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Český Krumlov se stal součástí světového kulturního dědictví, protoe<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(a)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">je důleitým střediskem průmyslu a obchodu České republiky<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(b)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">je atraktivní pro hodně zahraničních investorů<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(c)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">má mnoho historicky cenných architektonických památek<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(d)<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">leí blízko hranic s Rakouskem<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">III. Fill in the missing parts of speech.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Sloveso<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>substantivum<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">..<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>ochránit<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">snait se<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>..<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">..<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>vyuití<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">..<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>pomoc<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">zahájit<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>..<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">IV. Find synonyms for the underlined expressions.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><U><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">významné</SPAN></U><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"> lokality<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\"> </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><U><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">zahájit</SPAN></U><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"> přestavbu<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">největí <U>rozkvět</U><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\"> </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">architektonicky <U>zajímavý</U><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">historická <U>tvář</U> města<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>....<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">V. Put the words in brackets into appropriate forms.</SPAN></I><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Eva) .. bratr Jiří, student historie, má velmi rád (cestovat) .. po architektonicky zajímavých městech. Při své studijní cestě po jihu Čech měl příleitost seznámit se s (pět) .. nejznámějími městy, která kdysi patřila Romberkům. Velmi ho zaujalo město Třeboň, které se svou architekturou velmi podobá (Český Krumlov) .... . Během prohlídky českokrumlovského zámku se Jiří dozvěděl, e Vilém z Romberka zahájil ve (druhý) .. polovině estnáctého století přestavbu středověkého hradu na renesanční lechtické sídlo. V zámecké zahradě (vybudovat) .... roku 1958 letní divadlo s otáčivým hleditěm, (který)  láká mnoho návtěvníků z České republiky i ze zahraničí. Během sezony (představit) .. probíhají v přírodním prostředí letních nocí. Český Krumlov (připojit) .... v roce 1992 ke Světovému kulturnímu dědictví. Jiří si vechny informace pilně zapisoval, aby je mohl srovnat s historií (Jindřichův Hradec) ...., kam vedla jeho dalí cesta.</SPAN></P>', '2002-11-01 02:42:28', 467, 180, 100);
 Above all,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">people are disposed to mistake predicting troubles for</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">causing troubles and even for desiring troubles: \"If only,\"</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">they love to think, \"if only people wouldn\'t talk about it,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">it probably wouldn\'t happen.\"</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"> </SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"></SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 9pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">I</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\"> can already hear the chorus of execration  How dare I stir up trouble and</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">inflame feelings ? The answer is that I do not have the right not to do so.  A decent, ordinary fellow Englishman  says to me, his Member of Parliament,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">that his country will not be worth living in for his</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">children. I simply do not have the right to shrug my</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">shoulders and think about something else. What he is saying,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">thousands and hundreds of thousands are saying and</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">thinking - not throughout Great Britain, perhaps, but in</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">the areas that are already undergoing the total</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">transformation to which there is no parallel in a thousand</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">years of English history. In 15 or 20 years, on present</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">trends, there will be in this country three and a half</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">million Commonwealth immigrants and their descendants. </SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 9pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">B</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">ut while, to the immigrant, entry to this country was</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">admission to privileges and opportunities eagerly sought, the</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">impact upon the existing population was very different. For</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">reasons which they could not comprehend, and in pursuance of</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">a decision by default, on which they were never consulted,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">they found themselves made strangers in their own country.</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 9pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">T</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">hey found their wives unable to obtain hospital beds in</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">childbirth, their children unable to obtain school places,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">their homes and neighbourhoods changed beyond recognition,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">their plans and prospects for the future defeated; at work</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">they found that employers hesitated to apply to the immigrant</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">worker the standards of discipline and competence required of</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">the native-born worker; they began to hear, as time went by,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">more and more voices which told them that they were now the</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">unwanted</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">. </SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 9pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB> As I look ahead, I am filled with foreboding; like</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">the Roman, I seem to see \"the River Tiber foaming with much</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">blood\". That tragic and intractable phenomenon which we watch</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">with horror on the other side of the Atlantic but which</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">there is interwoven with the history and existence of the</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">States itself, is coming upon us here by our own volition and</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">our own neglect. Indeed, it has all but come. In numerical</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">terms, it will be of American proportions long before the end</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">of the century. Only resolute and urgent action will avert</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">it even now. Whether there will be the public will to demand</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> and </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">obtain that action, I do not know. All I know is that to see,</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'\"> </SPAN><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: normal; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt\">and not to speak, would be the great betrayal.</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 18pt 0cm 9pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt\">Original source: the Sterling Times web site  <A href=\"http://www.sterlingtimes.org/text_rivers_of_blood.htm\">http://www.sterlingtimes.org/text_rivers_of_blood.htm</A></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>', '2002-11-13 03:52:23', 528, 195, 100),
(98, 'Seznam skupin a písní na kazetě', '', 'Zde najdete seznam vech písní na kazetě.', '<TABLE border=0 cellPadding=9 cellSpacing=1 width=738>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><B><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Interpret/Skupina</B></FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><B><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Skladby</B></FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Petr Skoumal</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Hotelový pokoje</P>\r\n<P>Nájemní vrazi</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>YoYo Band</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Rybytví</P></FONT><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>To mě láká</P></FONT><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Karviná</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>um Svistu</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Světelný nářez</P>\r\n<P>Sviný Babylóňan</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Bára Basiková (Precedens)</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Doba ledová</P></FONT><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Dívčí válka</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>U jsme doma</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Nemilovaný svět</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Gará</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Má svoji hlavu (konec strany A)</P></FONT><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Muchomůrky</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Lucie</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Troubit na trumpety by se nám líbilo</P></FONT><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Dotkni se ohně</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Lucie Bílá</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Pán prstenů</P></FONT><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Láska je láska</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Laura a její tygři</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>ár trvá</P>\r\n<P>Laura a tygři</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Psí vojáci</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Nebe je zataený</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Buty</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Pokrývač</P>\r\n<P>Chtěl bych se jmenovat Jn</P></FONT><FONT size=3>\r\n<P>Mám jednu ruku dlouhou</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"28%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Načeva</FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=\"72%\"><FONT face=\"Times New Roman\" size=3>\r\n<P>Přítel</FONT></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE><FONT size=3>\r\n<P align=justify></P></FONT>', '2002-11-13 21:22:35', 572, 196, 110),
(99, 'Mid-Term Course Assessment', '', 'Feedback form about how the course is run.', '<H1 style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB\"><FONT face=Arial>Mid-term course assessment<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></FONT></SPAN></H1>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Please use other side or additional paper if you need more space.)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Name: _________________________________________ (Optional) <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 138pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB\">How would you assess your learning so far? Where do you see your strengths and weaknesses?<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 138pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB\">What in the course has been most effective for your learning so far?<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 138pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB\">What has been least effective?<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 138pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB\">Do you have any suggestions for change in the way the course is run?<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P> </P>', '2002-11-16 14:59:12', 293, 197, 110),
(100, 'Staré eny', 'Frantiek Halas (1935)', '', '<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">smutná odpoledne nedělní <?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">smutná starými paními <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">které se belhají k oknům <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">starou cestou vylapanou v koberci <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">starou cestou <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">mezi stolem a lůkem <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">mezi zrcadlem a fotografiemi <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=left><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS\">mezi idlí a falenou 