(1953, 1, 'Listening to numbers in context', '', 49, 'Listen and write down the numbers in appropriate fields', '<h3>Poznávací značka toho auta je: <a href=/tuit/sound/exercises/numbers/spz.mp3>POSLOUCHEJTE!</a></h3>\r\nčervený mercedes [$1, text 3:APH] [$1, text 2: 33] [$1, text 2: 48]<br>\r\nbílá koda [$1, text:LBC] [$1, text 2:89] [$1, text 2:21]<br>\r\nlutý trabant [$1, text 3:SML] [$1, text 2: 19] [$1, text 2: 12]<br>\r\nzelená tatra [$1, text 3:OPH] [$1, text 2: 61] [$1, text 2: 76]\r\n\r\n<h3>Můj telefon je: <a href=/tuit/sound/exercises/numbers/telefony.mp3>POSLOUCHEJTE!</a></h3>\r\ndomů [$1, text 3:045] [$1, text: 512] [$1, text: 53]<br>\r\ndo kanceláře [$1, text: 09] [$1, text: 116] [$1, text: 42] [$1, text: 350]<br>\r\nmobil [$1, text: 0978] [$1, text: 231] [$1, text: 456]\r\n\r\n<h3>Kdy se narodili? <a href=/tuit/sound/exercises/numbers/kdysenarodili.mp3>POSLOUCHEJTE!</a> </h3>\r\nbratr [$1, text: 1978] <br>\r\nmatka [$1, text: 1949] <br>\r\nsynovec [$1, text: 2001] <br>\r\nDarwin [$1, text: 1809] <br>\r\nKolumbus [$1, text: 1451] <br>\r\n\r\n\r\n', 3, NULL);
