(1629, 13, 'Erik Piper', '', 'Re: Help with a gift', 'Vude dobře, doma nejlépe (Everywhere good, at home best).\r\n\r\nI hope the accent marks show up OK on your screen; if not, they\'re --\r\n\r\n- a \"v-like\" mark over the s in Vsude and the r in dobre.\r\n- a bottom-left-to-top-right mark over the first e in nejlepe.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nErik', '2005-05-31 18:32:44', 1622, 0),
