(1633, 15, 'Dave Windsor', 'windsok47@hotmail.co.uk', 'Re: Most common words in Czech', 'Hi Robin,\r\n\r\nI think that what you have suggested is a great idea.  I\'ve had a look at the resource suggested by Vladimír,  From this list, I compiled my own list, which is basically the words from the resource, plus words that I use frequently with Czech friends and work contacts.  These will become the words that I will focus on as regards learning how they are conjugated or declined.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nDave.', '2005-06-03 14:37:52', 1584, 1);
