(1652, 13, 'Vladimír', '', 'Re: prs/prsy vs prso/prsa', 'prs (masc. noun entirely declined like hrad) = mamma (female only); plur. prsy = mammae;\r\n\r\nprsa (neutr. plurale tantum with rest of dual: do prsou, na prsou) = pectus (male or female, although somewhat different ;-)\r\n\r\nprso - a hypoth. sing. form derived from prsa (neutr.); sounds strange/funny to my ears;', '2005-06-08 16:48:03', 1643, 0),
