(1696, 13, 'George', 'happy2woof@yahoo.com', 'translation please?', 'Hi,\r\nI met girl last year in Czech Republic. She has sent me a letter in Czech but I can\'t read it at all! Would someone care to translate it for me? I would appreciate it greatly. Thanks!', '2005-06-21 09:22:47', 0, 1),
