(1855, 13, 'paxus calta', 'paxus@twinoaks.org', 'Czech months names', 'Dearest Erikk:\r\n\r\ni should have known, if i really wanted to find you, the place to look would have been google under \'\"Czech month names\" translation\'\r\n\r\nhow are you ?\r\nwhere are you ?\r\nwhat is the maximum velocity of a sparrow ?\r\n\r\nlots to tell\r\nif this actually gets thru\r\n\r\npaxus in avalon (twin oaks)\r\n23 new dinosaurs 2k6', '2006-04-24 01:17:50', 1715, 0),
(1857, 15, 'Kevin', 'handleyf@tesco.net', 'Re: Progress to learn Spanish Language', 'Czech is spelt like that in english\r\nHas this site got so boring (its participators) that I am replying to this  ... yep. I\'m one of them, no surprise there.\r\nWhere are you Eric the well Red in Czech at least? Gloria and a few others?', '2006-04-29 08:37:36', 1846, 0),
