p-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=229>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">avert<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR style=\"HEIGHT: 12.6pt; mso-yfti-irow: 12; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes\">\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 137.45pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 12.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=229>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I><SPAN lang=CS>ztřetěný<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; WIDTH: 137.45pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 12.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=229>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">crazy, wacky<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n<H1 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><SPAN lang=CS><FONT face=Arial size=5>Najděte synonyma:</FONT></SPAN></H1>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>prázdný dům</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>eny (formálně, ironicky)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>čas (začátek nového období)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>protoe (archaicky)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>drahý film</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>u (formálněji)</SPAN></P>\r\n<H1 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><SPAN lang=CS><FONT face=Arial size=5>Najděte odpovídající pasíva (adjektiva, substantiva):</FONT></SPAN></H1>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>situovat</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>nalézt</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>zaehnat</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>zmínit</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>očistit</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS>ohrozit</SPAN></P>\r\n<H1 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><SPAN lang=CS><FONT size=5><FONT face=Arial>Najděte adjektiva popisující kvalitu<o:p></o:p></FONT></FONT></SPAN></H1>', '2003-01-21 23:34:21', 347, 235, 100),
(85, 'Indecent Exposure', 'Tom Sharpe', 'Text selected for translation.', '<P class=MsoTitle style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt\"><STRONG><FONT face=Arial>Tom Sharpe: Indecent Exposure<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></FONT></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoTitle style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt\"><STRONG><FONT face=Arial>Chapter 1<o:p></o:p></FONT></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">It was Heroes Day in Piemburg and as usual the little capital of Zululand was quite unwarrantably gay. Along the streets the jacarandas bloomed unconscionable beside gardens flamboyant with azaleas while from a hundred flagpoles Britons and Boers proclaimed their mutual enmity by flying the Union Jack or the Vierkleur, those emblems of the Boer Was which neither side could ever forget. In separate ceremonies across the city the two white communities commemorated ancient victories. At the Anglican Cathedral the Bishop of Peimburg reminder his unusually large congregation that their ancestors had preserved freedom from such assorted enemies as Napoleon, President Kruger, the Kaiser and Adolf Hitler. At the Verwoerd Street Dutch Reformed Church the Reverend Schlachbals urged his flock never to forget that the British had invented concentration camps and that twenty-five thousand Boer women and children had been murdered in them. In short Heroes Day provided everyone with an opportunity to forget the present and revive old hatreds. Only the Zulus were forbidden to commemorate the occasion, partly on the grounds that they had no reputable heroes to honour but for the most part because it was felt that their participation would only lead to an increase in racial tension.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">To Kommandant van Heerden Piemburgs chief of police, the whole affair was most regrettable. As one of the few Afrikaners in Piemburg to be even slightly related to a hero (his grandfather had been shot by the British after the Battle of Paardeberg for ignoring the order to cease fire) he was expected to speak on the subject of heroes at the Nationalist rally at the Voortrekker Stadium and, besides, as one of the towns leading officials, he was obliged to attend the ceremony at Settlers Park where the Sons of England were inaugurating yet another wooden bench in honour of those who had fallen in the Zulu wars some hundred years before.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">In the past the Kommandant had been able to avoid all these engagement by pleading the impossibility of being in two places at the same time but since the police has recently been allocated a helicopter could be seen chattering across the city while the Kommandant, who disliked heights almost as much as he did public speaking, sorted through his notes in an effort to find something to say whenever he landed. Since his notes were ones he had used annually since the Congo Crisis years before, their illegibility and general lack of relevance caused some confusion. At the Voortrekker Stadium Kommandant van Heerdens speech on heroism included the assurance that the citizens of Piemburg need have no doubt that the South African Police would leave no stone unturned to see that nothing disturbed the even terror of their lives, while at Settlers Park his eloquence on behalf of the nuns who had been raped in the Congo, coming as it did after a passionate plea for racial harmony by a Methodist missionary, was considered not to be in the best of taste.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Finally, to round the days business off, there was parade of his men at the Mounter Police Barracks at which the Mayor had agreed to award a trophy for conspicuous bravery and devotion to duty.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Interesting what you had to say about those nuns, said the Mayor as the helicopter lifted off the ground at Settlers Park, Id almost forgotten about them. Must be twelve years ago that happened.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">I think its just as well to remind ourselves that it could happen here, said the Kommandant. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">I suppose so. Funny thing the way kaffirs always seem to go for nuns. Youd think theyd like something a bit more jolly.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Its probably because theyre virgins, said the Kommandant. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">How very clever of you think of that, said the Mayor, my wife will be relieved to hear it.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Below them the roofs glowed in the afternoon sun.<SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </SPAN>INSERT INTO `xc_articles` (`xca_id`, `xca_name`, `xca_author`, `xca_perex`, `xca_text`, `xca_time`, `xca_readers`, `xca_section`, `xca_priority`) VALUES
(87, 'Subsidiary Czech (Elementary) 2001-2002 Exam Paper', '', '', '<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">CZECH LANGUAGE AND LITERATURE</B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">CZECH LANGUAGE<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">SESSION 2001-2002<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>Subsidiary Czech (Elementary)</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>Paper1</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>(candidates should answer all <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">THREE</B> Sections)</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">SECTION A<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">(Essay in Czech)<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>(This section carries 30 % of the mark for this Paper)<B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">Write an essay in Czech on <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">ONE</B> of the following topics. Your essay should be about 150 words long: <o:p></o:p></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.2pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.2pt\">&nbsp;<SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\">1.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>\"<SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt\">BBC hledá překladatele z českého jazyka a redaktory do naí nové redakce pro země střední a<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>východní Evropy. Moný i částečný pracovní úvazek. Polete ivotopis s průvodním dopisem na<SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>adresu: Redakce BBC, Glasgow, Marihill Road 12, G12 AH.\" </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Odpovězte na inzerát. Napite stručný ivotopis a průvodní dopis, proč chcete<SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>pracovat jako překladatel/ka nebo redaktor/ka BBC. - <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">ivotopis, dopis</I><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">2.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></I><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN>Nejlepí jídlo mé babičky. (Co vechno potřebujete - recept na přípravu) - <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">popis<o:p></o:p></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\">3.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN>Roční období. (Nejraději mám jaro/léto/podzim/zimu, protoe...) - <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">vypravování</I> </P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\">4.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN>Vední den mých rodičů - <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">popis</I> </P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">5.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></I><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN>Člověk, na kterém mi záleí <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">- popis<o:p></o:p></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">6.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></I><SPAN style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</SPAN>Co pro mě znamená Rusko - <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">volný styl ( esej, vypravovování, dopisINSERT INTO `xc_articles` (`xca_id`, `xca_name`, `xca_author`, `xca_perex`, `xca_text`, `xca_time`, `xca_readers`, `xca_section`, `xca_priority`) VALUES
(89, 'Czech Level 2  2001-2002 Exam Paper', '', '', '<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">SESSION 2001  2002<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">CZECH LEVEL 2<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Candidates should answer <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">BOTH</B> sections.)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">SECTION A<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(This section carries 40</SPAN></I><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">% of the total mark for this Paper.)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Translation into English)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Translate into English:<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Američtí vojáci, i ve srovnání s Angličany a Francouzi, byli sluně oblečeni, dobře iveni. Dostali se a do Plzně, dále nesměli. Tomu jsme jetě nerozuměli. Nezajídal&#185; se nám nikdo, kdo vyhnal Němce. Měli za sebou krvavé operace, nesporné vítězství. Za chybu nebo podcenění Němců (jako u mostu u Remagenu) zaplatili. Měli na své straně pravdu, čest a vtip či lehkost, kterou si lidi spojovali s Amerikou, a teď byli v Praze na dovolence. Lidi jim trochu záviděli; snad, e je Amerika bohatá, a také, e je dál. Po esti letech, kdy Prahou zněla němčina a nacisti se netajili tím, e Čei v tomto prostoru nemají co pohledávat, se angličtina líbila. Američani se od vech liili&#178;. Netápali v nejistotě&#179;. Byli v Normandii, v Alsasku a v Berlíně, na své straně Labe. Vypadali sebevědomí, i kdy hledali jen taxík nebo se ptali na číslo tramvaje.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>Pátrala ve tvářích, které míjela. Co kdyby Ramon nezahynul<SUP>4</SUP>, ale ztratil se? Co kdy se někde otec s pokozenou pamětí snaí zjistit, kdo a co je? Snad ztratili pojem času i místa. Co kdyby nebyla pravda, e se tatínek vrhl v Auschwitz-Birkenau do drátů? Lidi, kteří ho viděli, se moná spletli, a nějakým zázrakem přeil. Skoro zapomněla, e ho sama viděla. Klame ji pamě? Toté si mohla myslet o mamince. Jestlie ila jetě tři dny před koncem války, třeba ji tenkrát na tom mostě jen postřelili a někde tady chodí a hledá jako tolik ostatních.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: right\" align=right><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Arnot Lustig)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&#185; zajídá se mi to </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">= Im fed up with it<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&#178; liit se </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">= to differ<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&#179; tápat</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"> v nejistot</SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">ě </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">= to grope in the dark<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SUP><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">4 </SPAN></SUP><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">zahynout </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">= to perish<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">SECTION B<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(This section carries 60% of the total mark for this Paper.)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Grammar and Comprehension)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">I. Fill each numbered blank with ONE appropriate word:<o:p></o:p></SPAN></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoPlainText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Generální konference UNESCO přijala v listopadu (1)</SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">INSERT INTO `xc_articles` (`xca_id`, `xca_name`, `xca_author`, `xca_perex`, `xca_text`, `xca_time`, `xca_readers`, `xca_section`, `xca_priority`) VALUES
(90, 'Senior Honours 2001-2002 Exam Paper (Translation into Czech and Essay in Czech)', '', '', '<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">SESSION 2001  2002<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>SLAVONIC AND EAST EUROPEAN STUDIES</P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>PAPER IA2</P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">(Translation into Czech and Essay in Czech)<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">(Candidates should answer <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">BOTH</B> sections.)<o:p></o:p></I></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">SECTION A<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">(Translation into Czech)</B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">Translate into Czech:</P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">(a)<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>As many as 10 new countries could join the European Union in a \"big bang\" expansion early in 2004, according to a report from the European Commission. The progress report gives the clearest hint yet that the 15-nation Union could soon be transformed, and its population expanded from 370 million to 450 million. </P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">Until recently no one thought such a drastic change was imminent. Diplomats had previously believed that an advance guard of a few countries, such as Hungary and Poland, would make up a first wave of entrants, with the others joining later in stages. But now Latvia, Lithuania and Slovakia have a realistic chance of entering the EU in little more than two years\' time, on the same timescale as bigger countries. </P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">The document brackets together eight countries: the Czech Republic, Estonia, Hungary, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland, Slovakia and Slovenia. While it concedes there are \"substantial differences\" between their performance in bringing their laws and economies into line with the EU, the Commission argues that, if efforts continue, these should be able to cope with \"competitive pressure and market forces within the Union in the near term\".</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: right\" align=right><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(The Independent)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: right\" align=right><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: right\" align=right><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">(b)<SPAN style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN>It was raining outside. Anna and Tomas (for he always went with her) came away from the hospital feeling exhausted. They drove back to the house, about twenty minutes away, and immediately went for a walk. They walked down the long field, following the line of the pine wood. The rain hung quietly about the trees and sometimes woodpigeon flew out as they passed by. The ground was full of muddy brown pools. Anna had pulled down the hood on her jacket so that her head would be soaked, and Tomas did the same. He walked beside her, stabbing at the pools with a piece of stick he had picked up. The smell of the pine wood and the rain soaked through the air and she breathed it deeply, like a tonic.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">When they had married, six years before, the difference in their ages had seemed unimportant. In itself it presented no great obstacle to fulfilment. Thomas Robertson was still healthy, he could still father children. And whatever had to be endured in the making, a child was worth it. Indeed Tomas was the reward for that nightly sacrifice she had made of herself on the altar-bed. Tomas was what it had all been for, and without him it would have all been for nothing. The man had made the boy and now the man must wither.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<P class=MsoBodyText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: right\" align=right>(Frank Shon)</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: right\" align=right><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<H1 style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><FONT size=3>SECTION B</FONT></H1>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><FONT size=2>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></FONT></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(Essay in Czech)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=center><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Write an e</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">ssay in Czech on <B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">ONE</B> of the following topics (your essay should have about 250 words):<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<H1 style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><FONT size=3>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></FONT></H1>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">1.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Co přináí globalizace lidstvu.</SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">2.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Česká kinematografie v 90. letech.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">3.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Srovnání postavení en v české a britské společnosti<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">4.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Je <EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-STYLE: normal\">cenzura v médiích přípustná? Problém rozsahu </SPAN></EM></SPAN><EM><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">n</SPAN></EM><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">ásilí v médiích a jeho vlivu na dospívající mláde. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></EM></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></EM></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">5.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></EM><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">V</SPAN></EM><EM><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">ýznam ekologických organizací.</SPAN></EM><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></EM></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></EM></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">6.<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></EM><EM><SPAN lang=CS style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-ansi-language: CS; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Jazyk a národní identita.</SPAN></EM><EM><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: normal; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></EM></P>', '2002-11-01 02:48:37', 659, 181, 100),
(91, 'Time and Seasons: Grammar', 'Elisabeth Jennings', '', '<H2 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><EM><FONT face=Arial>Grammar</FONT></EM></H2>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Allow, admit the brave, attentive verb,</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Be patient, watch it, keep a distance off,</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Think of an adjective, do not disturb</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">The music as it comes but let it move</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Around, among the words. Now you must curb</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Intruding conjugations, hold them off.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Listen, permit a polished noun. No rough</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Rhythm must ride or intervene or rub</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">And rinse away. Here is the leash of love,</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">The love of speech and the perfection of</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">A tongue thats true, an ear that is an orb</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Round which the very stars have room enough</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">For music of the spheres which will absorb</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">The awkward sentences and make them live</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Where prepositions dance and adverbs lob</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Their meaning wide but leashed by but or if.</P>', '2002-11-02 00:31:47', 344, 184, 100),
(92, 'Glad to Wear Glasses', 'John Hegley', '', '<H2 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><EM><FONT face=Arial>Weekend diary</FONT></EM></H2>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><FONT face=Arial>FRIDAY</FONT></H3>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Hot.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Stretched out on hilltop all afternoon</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">wondering am I in wrong job?</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Bloody Judas.</P>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><FONT face=Arial>SATURDAY</FONT></H3>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Stayed in.</P>\r\n<H3 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><FONT face=Arial>SUNDAY</FONT></H3>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Woke up feeling brilliant.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Visited friends  surprised to see me.</P>\r\n<H2 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><EM><FONT face=Arial>Photo in St James Park</FONT></EM></H2>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">a hot spring day by the lake</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">and a young woman and man</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">probably tourists possibly Spanish </P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">who wanted a photo of themselves together</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">handed their camera to someone</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">almost definitely English</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">who certain fellow countrymen</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">might predictably describe</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">as a very drunken old dosser</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">but to them he was just a passer by</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">he accepted the camera</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">took a long time focusing</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">and steadying himself</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">but managed to take the picture </P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">and received genuine gratitude</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">from the two</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">who had seen nothing deviant in his behaviour</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">and who would remember him as a friendly and helpful</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">English gentleman</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">if he hadnt fallen into the lake</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">with their camera</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">&nbsp;<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></P>\r\n<H2 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><EM><FONT face=Arial>Poem about my glasses</FONT></EM></H2>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">I look after my spectacles</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">because they look after me</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">without my spectacles</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">where would I be</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">Id probably be standing here</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">but Id have a job to see</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">properly</P>\r\n<H2 style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><EM><FONT face=Arial>In the arms of my glasses</FONT></EM></H2>\r\n<P class=NormalFirst style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">I go with you across the bridge</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">foot-sure in your thin embrace</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\">now I am good looking</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>', '2002-11-02 00:32:54', 633, 184, 100),
(93, 'Basket Case', 'Carl Hiaasen', 'Jetě jeden text, který bychom mohli přeloit.', '<P class=MsoTitle style=\"MARGIN: 12pt 0cm 3pt\"><STRONG><FONT face=Arial size=5>Carl Hiaasen, Basket Case (pp. 168-169)</FONT></STRONG></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Standing on the pier watching the horizon bleed away with the last of the sunlight, Im thinking about the only time I got engaged. Her name was Alicia and she was, I later discovered, mad as a hatter. I met her on a newspaper assignment, a feature story about a beer promotion disguised as a ballon raxse from St. Augistine to Daytona. Some guy left his boogie boad on the beach and I accidentally demolished it with a rental car, distracted at that moment by Alicia in an electric-blue bikini. The guy who owned the boogie board turned out to be her boyfriend, whom she dumped five days later to move in with me. We were both twenty four. The decision to become engaged was strictly hormonal, which isnt always foolish, but in this case the lust began to ebb long before the diamond ring was paid off. Among Alicias multiple symptoms were aversion to sleep, employment, punctuality, sobriety and monogamy. On the positive side, she volunteered weekends at an animal shelter.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Soon my apartment filled with ailing mutts that Alicia had saved from euthanasia while secretly consorting with one of the staff veterinarians, who (she later complained) took unfair advantage of her weakness for ketamine and nitrous oxide. Out breakup was a spiteful and messy business, mostly because of the loose dogs, yet Im amused to recall that I presented myself as heartbroken at the time. Within weeks I was again pursuing waitresses, emergency-room nurses and secretaries, an agreeable social orbit that accepted newspaper reporters without disdain. This carried me along until I met Anne, who worked in a bookstore. During out first conversation she managed to eviscerate Jane Austen with such aplomb that I was smitten on the spot. What she saw in me, I couldnt say.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Anne and I didnt fade out or implode like most of my other relationships. Back and forth we wenttogether, then apart, than together againas if caught on a wild spring tide. What finally ended out romance was my crushing demotion to the obituary beat and the morbid preoccupations that came with it. Anne didnt want to hear about people our age dyingwhether it was F. Scott Fitzgerald or the friend of mine in Colorado who keeled over while reeling in a ten-inch brook trout. Nor did she care to listen to morose, middle-of-the-night speculations about the demise of my long-gone father, though she was too gentle to interrupt. One morning she simply said goodbye and moved out. That time I knew she wasnt coming back because she took her favorite Nabokov novel, which shed always forgotten before, and a leather-bound volume of sonnets by John Donne (composed at the ripe old age of twenty-five).</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Such details make it all the more excruciating to know she has pledged herself to a hack writer of espionage novels. From <I>The Falconers Mistress</I>:</P>\r\n<P class=NormalIndented style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 27.5pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">The woman slipped her hands inside Dunquesnes fur-lined overcoat but drew away when she felt the ominous bulge of the holster.<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=NormalIndented style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 27.5pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">Now you know who I am, he said, pulling her face close to his. She gazed into his gray eyes with a mixture of dread and excitement. Ill leave, if you wish, he said.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=NormalIndented style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 27.5pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">She shook her head. Its cold outside, she whispered.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=NormalIndented style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 27.5pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\">He smiled. Its Prague, isnt it? Its always cold in Prague. Then he kissed her.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\">Sweet Christ Almighty, what is there to do but kill him? No jury in the world would convict me. Ive bookmarked that page as exhibit A, and the novel now accompanies me to Annes house. I believe it will simplify matters for the homicide crew.</P>', '2002-11-02 15:48:03', 505, 169, 120),
(94, 'Assignment 3: Politické vtipy', '', '<ul>\r\n<li>Summarize briefly the main points made by the writer (in Czech or in English)\r\n<li>Translate all the jokes quoted in the text\r\n<li>Determine the meaning of these words and phrases in their context <i>lze označit za, odmlčet se, vzmáhat se, polidovat, frčet, brát si na muku, zápletka, přičem, zlatá éra, zlatá totalita, přenést se přes sloitosti, kouzlo zakázaného </I>\r\n<li>Guess what is the usual word in the blank in this phrase: <i>smát se, a se za _______ popadat</i>. Why does substituting the word <i>mříe</i> make the joke funny?\r\n</ul>\r\nDue 15. 11. 2002.', '<P class=MsoTitle style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 3pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"><STRONG><FONT size=5><FONT face=Arial>Miroslav Korecký, Lidové noviny, 30. 12. 1999<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></FONT></FONT></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\">\"Padají Klaus, Zeman a Havel z mrakodrapu. Kdo dopadne jako první? To je jedno, dejte chladit ampaňské!\" Politických vtipů v posledních dvou třech letech přibývá. Jaký je tedy stav českého politického humoru v závěru roku 1999? V irím pojetí lze za politický vtip označit leccos: politický comics, politické kachny, kreslený politický vtip, politický kabaret, atd. Skutečnou esencí politického humoru ale jsou ústně ířené klasické anekdoty. A právě ty se před deseti lety téměř odmlčely, dnes se ale úspěně vzmáhají k nové zlaté éře. By je předem jasné, e předlistopadové obliby a slávy stěí kdy dosáhnou. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><B><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\">Politici vtipy milují</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"> \"Jsem rád, e se politický vtip opět vzmáhá, protoe politiku poliduje. Stav, kdy si národ přestane vymýlet vtipy na své politiky, je nezdravý,\" říká ministr vnitra Václav Grulich nynějí éf resortu, který za minulého reimu vypravěče vtipů naopak postihoval. Politický vtip, tedy lidová sranda na adresu politiků, je paradoxně mezi politiky velmi oblíben. \"Pro politika je sice inantní vyprávět vtipy politické nebo nesluné ale ony vlastně jiné nejsou,\" vysvětluje sněmovní matador Jiří Vlach. To ale neznamená, e jsou politici s úrovní vtipů kdovíjak spokojeni. Milovník suchého anglického humoru Karel Kühnl říká, e český vtip musí získat nadhled a nesmí být urálivý: \"Na to je ale asi potřeba několika desetiletí, ne lidé přestanou brát politiku tak zvířecky váně. Musí se také objevit osobnost velkého politického kabaretiéra. Bez ironie říkám, e tou je Milo Zeman ten se kabaretiérem narodil.\" Politický vtip dokonce můe politika přimět k zamylení. \"Nedávno jsem slyel vtip: `Proč má Václav Klaus tolik poradců? Aby měl komu radit.\' Nejdřív jsem se usmál, ale pak jsem o tom dlouho přemýlel, jestli na tom něco není,\" říká předseda ODS a dodává, e od té doby se snaí lidí kolem sebe se více ptát. Politici se netají tím, e politické vtipy milují. Poslanec Jiří Payne na své internetové stránce dokonce uvádí vtipy, které ve sněmovně \"frčí\". Např: \"Kolik poslanců je třeba ve sněmovně na výměnu árovky? Nadpoloviční větina.\" <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><B><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\">Havel, Klaus, Zeman </SPAN></B><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\">Forma i obsah dneních politických vtipů se příli nelií od dob před listopadem 1989. Na muku si vtip bere konkrétního politika nebo poměry jako takové a zápletka a pointa se často po celá desetiletí nemění. Současný politik v něm pouze nahradil Gustáva Husáka, Klementa Gottwalda, někdy snad dokonce Frantika Josefa I. Spektrum politiků, kteří pronikli do anekdot, je úzké. V naprosté větině vtipů figurují Václav Havel (v posledních třech letech obvykle celý prezidentský pár), Václav Klaus a Milo Zeman. Méně známí politici se objeví jen v souvislosti s nějakou výraznou vlastností (elezničářská profese Stanislava Grosse, tělesné proporce Petry Buzkové apod.). Výzkum agentury Factum z roku 1997 uvádí, e nejčastějí postavou vtipů je s velkým náskokem prezidentský pár (z něho častěji paní Dagmar). Podle výzkumu vtipy o Havlových nemívají úsměvný, ale spíe nenávistný charakter, často a s prvky nechutnosti (z tého důvodu LN jen obtíně hledaly publikovatelný vtip o Havlových). Za prezidentským párem následují Klaus a Zeman, přičem i v těchto případech se vtip často týká jejich fyzické likvidace apod. <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt\"><B><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\">Zlatá totalita...</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=CS style=\"mso-ansi-language: CS\"> V čem se lií dnení politický vtip od vtipu z dob totality? Setkat se s ním lze dnes nejen v ústním podání, ale i na internetu či v některých novinách a časopisech. Funkce vtipu zůstala podle sociologa Jana Hartla stejná: \"I dnes má úlevnou funkci jako v minulém reimu ani bych chtěl tyto reimy srovnávat. Vtip ve zkratce umoňuje člověku přenést se přes sloitosti ivota. Za dnení obrodou politického vtipu je asi právě tísnivý pocit mnoha lidí ze současného dění.\" V čem se ale dnení a starý dobrý komunistický vtip lií, je kouzlo zakázaného. Humorolog Václav Budinský říká, e politický vtip za totality pomáhal lidem bránit se společenské schizofrenii a přetvářce: \"Stal se nejen obrannou protilátkou, ale také kronikou, indikátorem společenské atmosféry, obrazem mylení lidí a jejich vztahu k totalitnímu reimu.\" Co je to ale za poitek, můe-li dnes člověk vyprávět vtip o Václavu Havlovi nahlas a přímo před prezidentskou kanceláří? Ostatně nejlépe to vyjadřuje zase vtip: \"Jaký je nejlepí politický vtip? Takový, kterému se člověk i po dvaceti letech směje, a se za mříe popadá.\"<?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>', '2002-11-03 16:27:24', 445, 141, 30),
(95, 'Christmas Card from a Hooker in Minneapolis', 'Tom Waits', '', '<P>Hey Charlie I\'m pregnant<BR>and living on the 9th Street<BR>right above a dirty bookstore<BR>off Euclid avenue<BR>and I stopped takin\' dope<BR>and I quit drinkin whiskey<BR>and my old man plays the trombone<BR>and works out at the track.</P>\r\n<P>And he says that he loves me<BR>even though its not his baby<BR>and he says that he\'ll raise him up<BR>like he would his own son<BR>and he gave me a ring<BR>that was worn by his mother<BR>and he takes me out dancin<BR>every Saturday night.</P>\r\n<P>And hey Charlie I think about you<BR>everytime I pass a fillin\' station<BR>on account of all the grease<BR>you used to wear in your hair<BR>and I still have that record<BR>of Little Anthony & the Imperials<BR>but someone stole my record player<BR>now how do you like that?</P>\r\n<P>Hey Charlie I almost went crazy<BR>after Mario got busted<BR>so I went back to Omaha to<BR>live with my folks<BR>but everyone I used to know<BR>was either dead or in prison<BR>so I  came back to Minneapolis<BR>this time I think I\'m gonna stay.</P>\r\n<P>Hey Charlie I think I\'m happy<BR>for the first time since my accident<BR>and I wish I had all the money<BR>that we used to spend on dope<BR>I\'d buy me a used-car lot<BR>and I wouldn\'t sell any of \'em<BR>I\'d just drive a different car<BR>every day, dependin\' on how I feel.</P>\r\n<P>Hey Charlie for Chrissakes<BR>do you want to know the truth of it?<BR>I don\'t have a husband,<BR>he don\'t play the trombone,<BR>and I need to borrow money<BR>to pay this lawyer.<BR>Charlie, hey<BR>I\'ll be eligible for parole<BR>come Valentine\'s day.</P>', '2002-11-04 04:33:46', 327, 184, 100),
