di-font-size: 10.0pt\">to keep ones hands off<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to lay (ones) hands on someone<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">many hands make light work<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">on ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">out of someones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to play into someones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to shake hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">a show of hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to sit on ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to soil/dirty ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to take ones life in ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to take the law into ones own hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to throw up ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to wash ones hands of<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">ODCIE<o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to be empty-handed<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(never) to lay a hand on someone<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to bury ones face/head in [ones hands]<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to do something with one hand tied behind ones back<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to fall into someones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to go through someones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to spread out ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to stick ones hands up<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">kiss your hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">a cloud no bigger than the size of a mans hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">a cool hand on a fevered brow<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">the dead hand of the past<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">(with) ones (own) fair hand(s)<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to give someone a big hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to play a lone hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">sleight of hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to take the cash (in hand) and let the credit go<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to be good with ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">on (ones) hands and knees<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to wring ones hands<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">an open hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">to ask for someones hand<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>\r\n<DIV style=\"mso-element: footnote-list\"><BR clear=all>\r\n<HR align=left width=\"33%\" SIZE=1>\r\n\r\n<DIV id=ftn1 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn1\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref1\" name=_ftn1><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[1]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Lakoff (1987:444). </FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn2 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn2\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref2\" name=_ftn2><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[2]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Lakoff and Johnson (1980:7ff.), Lakoff (1987:448), Ungerer and Schmid (1996:118), K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:326). </FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn3 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn3\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref3\" name=_ftn3><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[3]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Ungerer and Schmid (1996:117).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn4 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn4\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref4\" name=_ftn4><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[4]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Ungerer and Schmid (1996:117).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn5 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn5\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref5\" name=_ftn5><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[5]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Ungerer and Schmid (1996:121).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn6 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn6\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref6\" name=_ftn6><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[6]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Čermák (1982:144).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn7 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn7\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref7\" name=_ftn7><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[7]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See, for example Weinreich (1969), Makkai (1972), or Fernando (1996).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn8 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn8\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref8\" name=_ftn8><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[8]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> In this study, the term idiom will be used interchangeably with idiomatic expression.</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn9 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn9\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref9\" name=_ftn9><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[9]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Gibbs and OBrien (1990:36).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn10 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn10\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref10\" name=_ftn10><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[10]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> Makkai (1972:122).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn11 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn11\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref11\" name=_ftn11><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[11]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See also Tabossi and Zardon (1993:153).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn12 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn12\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref12\" name=_ftn12><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[12]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See also Swinney and Cutler (1979:532).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn13 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn13\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref13\" name=_ftn13><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[13]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> Gibbs and Nayak (1991:94).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn14 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn14\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref14\" name=_ftn14><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[14]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See also Gibbs (1995:113).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn15 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn15\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref15\" name=_ftn15><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[15]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See also Wasow (1983:109).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn16 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn16\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref16\" name=_ftn16><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[16]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Weinreich (1969:260).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn17 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn17\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref17\" name=_ftn17><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[17]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> For a definition of predictability of idiom meanings, see Nunberg <I style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\">et al. </I>(1994:495), who says: The meanings of an idiom cannot be predicted on the basis of a knowledge of the rules that determine the meaning or use of its parts when they occur in isolation from one another.</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn18 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn18\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref18\" name=_ftn18><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[18]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> Gibbs and OBrien (1990:37).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn19 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn19\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref19\" name=_ftn19><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[19]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> Also called target scene and donor scene by Goossens (1990:332).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn20 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn20\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref20\" name=_ftn20><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[20]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See References.</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn21 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn21\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref21\" name=_ftn21><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[21]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Lakoff (1980).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn22 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn22\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref22\" name=_ftn22><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[22]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> The idioms <SPAN lang=EN-GB style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-GB\">to have a mind/brain/memory like a sieve are also very frequent.</SPAN> </FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn23 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn23\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref23\" name=_ftn23><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[23]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn24 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn24\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref24\" name=_ftn24><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[24]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn25 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn25\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref25\" name=_ftn25><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[25]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn26 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn26\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref26\" name=_ftn26><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[26]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn27 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn27\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref27\" name=_ftn27><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[27]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn28 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn28\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref28\" name=_ftn28><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[28]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn29 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn29\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref29\" name=_ftn29><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[29]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See K<SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\"><SPAN style=\"mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'\">ö</SPAN></SPAN>vecses and Szabó (1996:337).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn30 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn30\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref30\" name=_ftn30><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[30]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See also Nayak and Gibbs (1990:329).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn31 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn31\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref31\" name=_ftn31><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[31]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Carter (1998:223).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn32 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn32\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref32\" name=_ftn32><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[32]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See, for example, McGlone and Glucksberg (1994:167).</FONT></P></DIV>\r\n<DIV id=ftn33 style=\"mso-element: footnote\">\r\n<P class=MsoFootnoteText style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><A title=\"\" style=\"mso-footnote-id: ftn33\" href=\"http://www.bohemica.com/editworks/#_ftnref33\" name=_ftn33><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"mso-special-character: footnote\"><SPAN class=MsoFootnoteReference><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">[33]</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></A><FONT size=2> See Cacciari and Tabossi (1993:xii).</FONT></P></DIV></DIV>', '2003-06-08 16:09:48', 5195, 14, 20);
