ss=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Had I met her anywhere else, I wouldnt have recognized her</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Potkat ji jinde, byl bych ji nepoznal</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAD BETTER</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Wed better be going</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Raději bychom u měli jít</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HARD TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He is hard to please</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Je těké mu vyhovět<br />\r\nTěko se mu vyhoví</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAVE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He had his pockets picked</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Byly mu ukradeny věci z kapsy</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAVE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">I wont have you going there<br />\r\nI wont have you coming here<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI wont have you yelling at me</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Nechci abys tam chodil<br />\r\nNepřipustím, abys tam el<br />\r\nNechoď mi sem<br />\r\nNepřipustím, abys na mne kříčel</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAVE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The boy had his hand crushed</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Chlapci byla rozdrcena ruka (?)<br /></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAVE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He always has crowds attending his concerts</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Na jeho koncerty vdycky chodí davy lidí</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAVING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Having arrived at a decision, he dismissed the matter from his mind<br />\r\nHaving delimited the field of enquiry, we shall concentrate on...</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Kdy dospěl k rozhodnutí, pustil tu záleitost z hlavy<br />\r\nKdy jsme si vymezili oblast zkoumání, soustředíme se na...</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HAVING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">All attempts at reconciliation having failed, nobody saw any reason for prolonging his or her stay</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Jeliko (kdy) vechny pokusy o usmíření selhaly, nikdo neviděl ádný důvod aby tu nadále zůstával</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HOW</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">How I envy you<br />\r\nHow odd!<br />\r\nHow obstinate he is! </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Tak vám závidím<br />\r\nTo je ale divné<br />\r\nKdy on je tak tvrdohlavý </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HOW ABOUT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">How about golf on Sunday?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Co si takhle zahrát v neděli golf? <br />\r\nZahrejme si v neděli golf</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">HOWEVER</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">It is my duty, however unpleasant I may find it</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Je to moje povinnost, a je mi to jakkoliv nepřijemné<br />\r\n...a je mi to jak chce nepřijemné </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">IDEA</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The idea of a man his age marrying again!</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Člověk v jeho věku a jetě se enit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">IF ONLY</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">If I only knew</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Kdybych jen tak věděl</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">IN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">In opening the window, I felt the cold air</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Při otvírání okna, cítil jsem chladný vzduch<br /><br /></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">-ING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">We can offer you a job cleaning cars</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Můeme vám nabidnout práci - mytí aut<br />  </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">- ING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">I found him sitting</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Nael jsem ho jak seděl<br />\r\nNael jsem ho sedící (bookish)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">-ING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">I had a long talk with her explaining why she should go </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Dlouho jsem s ní povídal během něho jsem vysvětlil...<br />\r\nDlouho jsem si s ní povídal,  přičem jsem jí vysvětlil<br />\r\nDlouho jsem s ní povídal a vysvětlil jsem jí...</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">-ING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">She lay on the sofa reading<br />\r\nShe went out shutting the door behind her<br />\r\nHe came running<br />\r\nHe went off staggering</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Leela na gauči a četla<br />\r\nVyla ven a zavřela za sebou dveře<br />\r\nPřiběhl<br />\r\nOdvrávoral</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">-ING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He led the way down the slope, his shadow stretching behind him in the grass</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">el první dolů ze svahu a jeho stín se za ním táhl po trávě</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">INTONATION</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He <i>will</i>\r\n be pleased<br />\r\nWe <i>have</i>\r\n enjoyed ourselves</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Bude tak potěen<br />\r\nMoc se nám to líbilo</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">JEN KDY</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">I\'m glad you\'re back!</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Jen kdy u jsi doma!</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">JUST</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">I just caught the train</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Jen taktak jsem chytil vlak<br />\r\nSotva jsem ten vlak chytil</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">LEAST</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He doesnt have the least chance</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Nemá sebemení anci<br />\r\nNemá vůbec ádnou anci</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">LET</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Let that be a lesson for you</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Nech je to pro vás ponaučení</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">LET ALONE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">She cannot type properly, let alone write shorthand<br />\r\nThere were seven people in the car, let alone a pile of luggage</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Neumí ani psát pořádně na stroji, nato aby uměla těsnopis<br />\r\nV autě bylo sedm lidí, nehledě na hromadu zavazadel</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">LIFT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Could you give me a lift?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Mohl byste mě svézt</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">MAKE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The book made him famous</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-