ransparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Je jedním z těch, kteří se vdycky hádají se svými sousedy</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">ON EARTH</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Who on earth told you that?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Kdo ti to pro pána řekl?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">ONLY JUST</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The light is only just enough for reading</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Světlo tu je zrovna tak na čtení<br />\r\nSvětlo tu je akorát tak na čtení</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">ONLY TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">We have avoided one problem only to come up against another</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Vyhnuli jsme se jedné obtíi,