=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The cooking is good there<br />\r\nIts a comfortable place to live in<br />\r\nWhat a nice place for children to play</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Dobře se tam vaří<br />\r\nPohodlně se tam bydlí<br />\r\nTady se to dětem hraje </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">REST ASSURED</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">You may rest assured of our support</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Můete si být jist naí podporou</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">SEE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The sixties saw several natural disasters</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">V edesátých letech dolo k několika přirodným pohromám</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">SHOULD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium non