\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">THIS IS</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">This is a book you ought to read<br />\r\nThis is where we get out</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Tuhle knihu by sis měl přečíst<br />\r\nTady vystupujeme</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">THERE IS</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">There is a museum in the manor now<br />\r\nThere is a team of archeologists digging at the site</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">V zámku je nyní museum<br />\r\nNa naleziti pracuje tým archeologů</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">To her disappointment, he didnt appear<br />\r\nTo our astonishment, he ate everything</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">K jejímu zklámání, neobjevil se<br />\r\nK naemu úasu, vechno jedl</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The best man to send is John<br />\r\nHe is definitely not a man to trifle with<br />\r\nShe is not a person to trust with such a task</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Ten nejlepí, koho můeme poslat, je Jan<br />\r\nRozhodně to není člověk, kterého by bylo mono ertovat<br />\r\nNení osobou, které lze svěřit takový úkol</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The advantages to be gained<br />\r\nThere are, however, two difficulties to be overcome</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Výhody, které lze ziskat<br />\r\nJsou vak dvě otíe, které je třeba překonat/musíme překonat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">You were a fool to do it<br />\r\nI awoke to find the room flooded by sunshine</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Byl jsi blázen, e jsi to udělal<br />\r\nVzbudil jsem se v pokoji zalitém sluncem</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Selflessness, a rare quality<br />\r\nThe waltz, a long-forgotten dance</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Obětavost, vzácná (to) vlastnost<br />\r\nValčík, tanec (to) dávno zapomenutý</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO JUDGE BY</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The parcel, to judge by its shape, contains a book</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Balíček, soudíc podle jeho tvaru, obsahuje knihu</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO THINK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">To think I let myself be cheated like that</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Dát se tak obalamutit<br />\r\ne jsem se dal tak obalamutit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TO HEAR YOU</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Anyone would think, to hear you, that you dont care about success</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Slyet vás, kadý by myslel, e nedbáte o úspěch</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TREAT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He treated us to one of his anecdotes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Počastoval nás jednou ze svých anekdot</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">TRY TO/ING</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Ill try to come early<br />\r\nHave you ever tried walking on stilts?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Vynasnaím se přijít brzy<br />\r\nZkouel jsi někdy chodit na chůdách?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">VDY</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">You told me yourself didnt you?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Vdy jsi mi to sám říkal</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WHAT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">What ideas he has</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Ten má ale nápady</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WHAT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">What a silly joke</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Takový hloupý vtip</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WHAT...THERE WAS</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">What sand there was was coarse</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Vechen písek, který byl k dispozici byl hrubý</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WHATEVER</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Whatever I do, he is never satisfied</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Cokoliv udělám, nikdy není spokojen<br />\r\nA udělám cokoliv, nikdy není spokojen<br />\r\nA udělám co chci, nikdy není spokojen</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WHENEVER</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Whenever the boys are so submissive they are up to some mischief</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Vdycky, kdy jsou chlapci tak posluní, mají za lubem nějaké roáctví</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WILL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The window wont open</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Okno nejde otevřit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WILL (characteristic behaviour)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He will sit for hours at the window</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Sedává celé hodiny u okna</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WILL (characteristic behaviour)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He will get angry over nothing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Rozzlobí se pro maličkost</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WILL (probability)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">That will be the postman</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">To bude listono<br />\r\nTo je asi listono</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WILL (certainty)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">You will have heard about it of course</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Jistě jste o tom u slyel</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WITH</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">With all this work</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">S tím vím co mám na práci</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WITH A BIT OF LUCK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">With a bit of luck, things would have turned out differently</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Při troe těstí by to bylo dopadlo jinak</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WONDER</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">I wonder if it is raining</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Jestlipak prí<br />\r\nRád bych věděl, zda prí <br />\r\nJsem zvědav jestli prí</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WORTH</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Shes not worth getting angry with</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Ta ti nestojí za rozčilování</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD (Typical)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">You <i>would</i>\r\n tell her that</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">To je pro tebe typický, e</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD, (willingness)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">She would hoover but she didn\'t like cleaning windows</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">ona by bývala mohla luxovala - ale nerada myla okna</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD (past of will)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">The window wouldnt open</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Okno nechtělo otevřit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD (polite)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Would you follow me</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Pojďte prosím za mnou</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD (iterative) <br />\r\nexample from &quot;Three Men in a Boat&quot;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Then he would lift up the picture and drop it and it would come out of the frame and he would try to save the glass</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">A pak zvedl obraz a obvykle ho upustil. Obraz vypadl z rámu a strýc se snaíval zachránit sklo</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD (conjecture)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">She would have been a nurse at that time</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Byla tehdy asi zdravotní sestra</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">WOULD YOU SAY</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">How old would you say she was?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Jak byste řekl, e je stará?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">YOU SEE</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">You see she turned pale as if she were going to faint </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Ona vám zbledla, jako kdy jdou na ní mdloby </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">He smiled his approval</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: medium none rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0.75pt; background-color: transparent;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">Souhlasně se usmál<br />\r\nUsmál se, aby vyjadřil svůj souhlas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 align=\"center\" style=\"margin: auto 0cm; text-align: center;\">Sources:<br /></h4><h4 align=\"center\" style=\"margin: auto 0cm; text-align: center;\">Novočeská skladba - Vladimír milauer - SPN<br />\r\nAnglická mluvnice - Karel Hais - SPN<br />\r\nMluvnice současné angličtiny na pozadí četiny - Libue Duková - Academia</h4>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center;\"><shapetype>\r\n<stroke joinstyle=\"miter\">&nbsp;</stroke>\r\n<formulas>\r\n<f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n<f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\">&nbsp;</f>\r\n</formulas>\r\n<path gradientshapeok=\"t\">&nbsp;</path>\r\n<lock aspectratio=\"t\">&nbsp;</lock>\r\n</shapetype>\r\n<shape id=\"_x0000_i1025\" style=\"width: 24pt; height: 24pt;\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\">&nbsp;</shape>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '2003-07-12 05:18:12', 4092, 258, 106);
