&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\r\nMinor: General Linguistics<p></p>\r\n</font>\r\n</span>\r\n</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm -72pt 0pt 0cm; tab-stops: 36.0pt 108.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><font face=\"Times\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\r\nCandidate<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\r\nUniversity of Louvain, Belgium, 1976 <p></p>\r\n</font>\r\n</span>\r\n</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm -72pt 0pt 0cm; tab-stops: 36.0pt 108.0pt\"><font face=\"Times\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\r\n</span>\r\n</i>\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">Department of General Linguistics<p></p>\r\n</span>\r\n</font>\r\n</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm -72pt 0pt 0cm; tab-stops: 36.0pt 108.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\"><font face=\"Times\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\r\nLicenciee<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\r\nUniversity of Brussels, Belgium, 1975<p></p>\r\n</font>\r\n