\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0cm\">zh</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 122.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=163>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0cm\">plea<B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">s</B>ure</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 122.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=163>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0cm\"><B style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\">zh</B>urmë</P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n<H1>Some Information About Albanian</H1>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>Albanian language belongs to the family of Indo-European languages. It is one of the oldest languages, yet different from the others. Albanian language seems to have kept its own features from very ancient times. The earliest text in Albanian known so far is the \"Baptizing Formula\", written in 1462. Historically, unified national literary Albanian can be traced to 1908, when the decision was made to accept the Latin alphabet. Since 1972, the unified literary language remains the only one used in Albanian and Yugoslavia.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal>Albanian language is spelled more or less phonetically. Each letter has a specific sound that doesn\'t change in the context, making its reading and writing rather easy. As a rule, Albanian spelling corresponds to the pronunciation of words quite directly. The alphabet has 36 letters, 29 consonants and 7 vowels. There are two main dialects, the Geg dialect in the North of Albania and the Tosk dialect in the South. In spite of the differences of the two main dialects, both spoken and written Albanian are understood by all Albanians. Education and mass media have facilitated this process. Today Albanian is spoken by about 10 million people around the world, 3.5 million in Albania, 3 million in Yugoslavia (Kosova, Macedonian, Serb and Montenegro), over 1 million in Turkey, as well as large groups of Albanians in South Italy (known as Arbereshe), Greece, Europe, USA, Canada and Australia.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoListBullet style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 35.45pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.85pt; tab-stops: list 35.45pt left 94.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Symbol\">ˇ<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN>Albanian is an inflected language, which means that grammatical endings play an indispensable role in the language grammatical system.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoListBullet style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 35.45pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.85pt; tab-stops: list 35.45pt left 94.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Symbol\">ˇ<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN>Adjectives are inflected for gender, number and case.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoListBullet style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 35.45pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.85pt; tab-stops: list 35.45pt left 94.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Symbol\">ˇ<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN>Verbs are inflected for three persons, both singular and plural.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoListBullet style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 35.45pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.85pt; tab-stops: list 35.45pt left 94.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Symbol\">ˇ<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN>Nouns are declined in all their cases and they have different endings for each case.</P>\r\n<P class=MsoListBullet style=\"MARGIN: 6pt 0cm 0pt 35.45pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.85pt; tab-stops: list 35.45pt left 94.0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Symbol\">ˇ<SPAN style=\"FONT: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN>Remember, language learning is not only important and demanding, it is FUN. </P>\r\n<H1 style=\"PAGE-BREAK-BEFORE: always\">Critical Phrases</H1>\r\n<TABLE border=1 cellPadding=0 cellSpacing=0 style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Yes</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Po<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">No</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Jo<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Good morning!</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Mirmëngjes!<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Good evening !</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Mirëmbrëma!<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Good bye!</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Mirupafshim!<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Please!</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Ju lutem!<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Excuse me.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Më falni<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Thank you (very much)!</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Faleminderit (shumë)!<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Welcome!</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Mirë se erdhët!<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">I speak only English.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Unë flas vetëm Anglisht.<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">I don\'t speak Albanian.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Unë nuk flas Shqip.<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">I am from the United States.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Unë jam nga Amerika.<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">I am American.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Unë jam amerikan.<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">Please, speak more slowly.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Ju lutem, flisni ngadalë.<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">I understand.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=306>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\"><B>Unë kuptoj.<o:p></o:p></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 232.2pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt\" vAlign=top width=310>\r\n<P class=MsoNormal style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt\">I don\'t understand.</P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; WIDTH: 229.6pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid