(146, 'Reading Assignments', 'Reading Assignments', 'Description of weekly reading assignments, additional readings, and links.', 'Every week, students are expected to read the assigned text and complete their reading tasks. The tasks consist of broad focus questions. ', 93, '2006-07-05 18:53:06', 10, 10, '', '', 0),
