(188, 'Testing WebEdit', 'Testing WebEdit', '', 'This section is the designating testing area. Create as many subsections, articles, textboxes, etc. as you wish. You can also delete them. Don\'t delete anything else on the site!!!<p>\r\n\r\n<large><a href=admin/index.php?m=catalog&s=188>Click here to edit this section!</a></large>', 9, '2004-10-09 00:01:29', 100, 100, '', '', 1),
