=\"21\" colspan=\"3\"><p>Czech for foreigners at all levels,(based on French or English) offerd by a teacher with state exam of pedagogy, now finishing Czech studies, teaching also beginners of English and French.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr width=\"80%\" size=\"3\" color=\"#000099\" />\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Name:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\">Jana Blaejová  </td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"43%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\">Prague, Czech Republic</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Contact:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\" colspan=\"3\"><p><a href=\"mailto:janabla@email.cz\">janabla@email.cz</a>\r\n<font size=\"2\">; </font>\r\n604716255</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Services:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\" colspan=\"3\"><p>Private and group instructions at all levels (based on French and English).</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr width=\"80%\" size=\"3\" color=\"#000099\" />\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Name:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\">Iva Papírníková  </td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"43%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\">Prague, Czech Republic</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Contact:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\" colspan=\"3\"><p><a href=\"mailto:locamoc@atlas.cz\">locamoc@atlas.cz</a>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"21\"><b>Services:</b>\r\n </td>\r