s:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\"><p>Conversation, private lessons.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n', 25, 0, 1);
INSERT INTO `xc_text` (`xct_id`, `xct_header`, `xct_text`, `xct_section`, `xct_type`, `xct_priority`) VALUES
(9, '', '<hr width=\"80%\" size=\"3\" color=\"#000099\" align=center>\r\nThese materials were created by Dominik Luke. He has had extensive contacts with foreigners settling in the Czech Republic and other  countries in the region, working as a language specialist for the US Peace Corps in Eastern Europe and Central Asia. He has studied culture and worked as a facilitator in over 20 countries around the world. He has contributed articles on language and culture to various publications. Some of the materials were developed for a cultural adjustment workshop run by Linguapool. Others as part of various Peace Corps contracts. Source of adopted materials is noted.\r\n<hr width=\"80%\" size=\"3\" color=\"#000099\" align=center>', 5, 0, 150);
INSERT INTO `xc_text` (`xct_id`, `xct_header`, `xct_text`, `xct_section`, `xct_type`, `xct_priority`) VALUES
