w.gif\" />\r\n </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"43%\" valign=\"top\">UK, London </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Contact:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"mailto:Hisemova@seznam.cz\">Hisemova@seznam.cz</a>\r\n<br />\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Services:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\">Czech translation, tuition, interpreting and teaching by a qualifiedand experienced teacher. (3-year experience in teaching, master\'sdegree - the Czech and English languages)<br />\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr />\r\n<br />\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Name:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\" valign=\"top\"><p>SCOLA Sutton Col Adult Learng <img width=\"34\" height=\"10\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/images/new.gif\" />\r\n </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"43%\" valign=\"top\">UK, London </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Contact:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"mailto:reception@scola.ac.uk\">reception@scola.ac.uk</a>\r\n </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Services:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\">Run beginners evening course, and will reinstate second year if one ortwo more people are interested. Please register your interest withreception. <br />\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"width: 100%; height: 2px;\" />\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Name:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\" valign=\"top\"><p>Lucie Gavlasová <img width=\"34\" height=\"10\" border=\"0\" src=\"../images/new.gif\" />\r\n </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"43%\" valign=\"top\">Germany, near Bonn </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Contact:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"L.Gavlasova@aol.com\">L.Gavlasova@aol.com</a>\r\n; 02683/945844 </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Services:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\">Qualified teacher, 4 years experience in teaching of Czech language forforeigners, private tuition for all levels, translation andinterpreting (Czech-German).</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"width: 100%; height: 2px;\" />\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Name:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\" valign=\"top\"><p>Vít Bezdíček <img width=\"34\" height=\"10\" border=\"0\" src=\"../images/new.gif\" />\r\n </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"43%\" valign=\"top\">UK, London </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Contact:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"mailto:bezd@volny.cz\">bezd@volny.cz</a>\r\n, 07985 940 681 </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Services:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"86%\" valign=\"top\" colspan=\"3\">Private instruction at all levels, translation from English to Czech, Czech to English.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"width: 100%; height: 2px;\" />\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"14%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Name:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\" valign=\"top\"><p>Jitka Hastings <img width=\"34\" height=\"10\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/images/new.gif\" />\r\n </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"15%\" valign=\"top\"><b>Location:</b>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\